# Example allowed_signers file (~/.config/git/allowed_signers)
# Maps SSH signing public keys to contributor email addresses for GitHub "Verified" attribution.
#
# Format: <email> <key-type> <public-key> <optional-comment>
#
# Maintainer Key (used for release tags and human commits)
maintainer@example.com ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAI... maintainer-key

# Agent Signing Key (used for local autonomous AI agent commits)
maintainer@example.com ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAI... agent-local-key
